# Real secrets live in .env next to the compose file. Never commit it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env

# Your real Caddyfile holds your real hostnames. In this public folder it stays
# out of git: copy Caddyfile.example to conf/Caddyfile and edit it there.
# (In your own PRIVATE edge repo, where CI bakes conf/Caddyfile into the image,
# delete these two lines so the Caddyfile is committed.)
conf/
Caddyfile
